SUMMARY:Divine Surrendering - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ DJ Mikaya
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, September 9th\n\n1st D
 ance Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dan
 ce Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacili
 tator DJ Mikaya (Micah Swabb(\n\n**Intention: Divine Surrendering**\n\nOh\
 , give up control again\nIt's ok not to know again\nFeeling in the dark\nC
 rawling till I walk\nEach time that I fall\nDivine Remembering\nHolding on
  too tight\nTrying till I might\nTire from the fight\nDivine Surrendering\
 nSafe to surrender now\nSafe to remember how\nI release what is not meant 
 for me\nI believe what's meant for me will be for me\nFeeling in the dark\
 nCrawling till I walk\nEach time that I fall\nDivine Remembering\nHolding 
 on too tight\nTrying till I might\nTire from the fight\nDivine Surrenderin
 g\nTime\nOh\, take me back home again\nOh\, I am walking alone again\nTime
 \nTime\n*Lyrics by Doe Paoro*\n\nAn ecstatic dance wave inspired by the ly
 rics of this song. We are aiming to lift and land gracefully for our colle
 ctive heart space.\n\n## About DJ Mikaya\n\nDJ Mikaya (Micah Swabb) is a f
 acilitator at AMC and creator of dance waves with many styles and flavors 
 within the Ecstatic Dance realm. His deejay skill has spanned over two dec
 ades covering many ecstatic dance containers\, festivals\, sound healing e
 vents and yoga classes. You can listen to his catalog of over 80 mixes and
  mashups at [http://soundcloud.com/mikayaswabb](http://soundcloud.com/mika
 yaswabb).\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm
  up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and people who arrive late
  will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure contai
 ner. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one turned awa
 y for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nFirst 
 Wave: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/uqbb](https://ashevillemove
 mentcollective.org/uqbb)\nSecond Wave: [https://ashevillemovementcollectiv
 e.org/6r3x](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/6r3x)\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nW
 e need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:
  [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemov
 ementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURE
 xqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rM
 D5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPO
 RTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circ
 le. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective a
 greements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://a
 shevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBE
 xVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bG
 lkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCc
 IA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that mo
 ves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a lo
 ving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and health
 y community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal an
 d community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\n
 See you on the dance floor!
