SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance LIVE Music w/ Jaffe and Friends
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, September 11th\nEvenin
 g Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\
 nLIVE Music w/ Jaffe and Friends \\| Support Facilitator: Kris Hostikka\n\
 nIntention: Grounding in Rhythm\nWe move through a journey of sound—Afri
 can and Latin rhythms woven into jamtronica\, alongside flowing electronic
  music.\nA drum-centric passage will bring the djembe and percussion forwa
 rd\, inviting us deeper into the heartbeat of the rhythm.\nFrom grounded p
 ulse to expansive grooves\, we open to free expression\, joyful release\, 
 and deep connection.\n\nAbout the Musicians:\nJaffe is a Music producer an
 d multi-instrumentalist blending electronic instruments\, guitar\, and dje
 mbe. He has Studied West African drumming and incorporates live looping in
 to layered immersive soundscapes spanning many genres. Performing for danc
 es across South Florida and Asheville\, he creates music that invites free
  movement and deep connection.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the
  dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and a
 ny that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe 
 and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $25-50 or name your price.\nN
 o one turned away for lack of funds!\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\n[ht
 tps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/live-music-20260911/](https://
 ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/live-music-20260911/)\n\nVOLUNTEER!\
 n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer
  at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevil
 lemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ
 0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAET
 f8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nI
 MPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening
  circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollect
 ive agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](http
 s://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYn
 JpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFI
 NP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootR
 UE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world th
 at moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within
  a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and h
 ealthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for person
 al and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization
 .\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance f
 loor!
