SUMMARY:Dance Medicine - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Rory Jagdeo
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, September 13th\n1st Da
 nce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Danc
 e Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilit
 ator Rory Jagdeo\n\nIntention: Dance Medicine\n\nDance Medicine \\~ Anonym
 ous\nThis is the medicine each of us needs\nTo come awake and be healed\nT
 o be emptied and refilled\nWith joy\nWith hope\nWith courage\nWith love\nF
 or our own selves\nSo we can become the medicine\nFor the world\n\n## Abou
 t Rory Jagdeo\n\nRory is a singer/songwriter and an AMC Facilitator. He st
 epped into Ecstatic Dance in Houston\, TX for the first time in 2014 and b
 elieves in the power of dance to transform and bring a healthier\, happier
 \, and connected lifestyle. It is that driving force and passion that push
 es him to explore the role of being an Ecstatic Dance Facilitator using wo
 rld rhythms and different musical genres to weave mixes that incorporate m
 any elements of 8Rhythms.\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance 
 starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that
  come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and sec
 ure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo 
 one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUN
 TEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to vol
 unteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://a
 shevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBE
 xMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qU
 H1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YA
 fA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the
  opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\
 nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-danc
 e/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW
 0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIA
 AR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXd
 VB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a 
 world that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selve
 s within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authentici
 ty and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves fo
 r personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit orga
 nization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the
