 e Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilit
 ator Ted Riskin\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Ted Riskin\n\nTed is interes
 ted in anything that can get him out of his head\, and music and movement 
