 inner journey and invitations that create a shift. While he likes modern e
 lectronic music\, he can’t create a mix without including lots of natura
 l instruments and voices. Due to a short attention span\, he mixes in lots
  of different musical genres. You can hear some of his mixes on [https://w
 ww.mixcloud.com/tarisk/](https://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\
 \*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close prompt
 ly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be
